'''Big Malasada''' (Japanese: '''おおきいマラサダ''' ''Big Malasada'') is an {{TCGP|Item}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Item
|rule=SWSH Item
|effect=Heal 10 damage and remove a random Special Condition from your Active Pokémon.
}}

==Trivia==
* {{TCGP|Pokémon Center Lady}} has a more potent version of this card's effect, but as a {{TCGP|Supporter card}} instead of an Item card.
* This card's effect is similar to that of the {{TCG|Big Malasada}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but this card heals 10 damage instead of 20, and the healed {{TCG|Special Condition}} is chosen at random.

===Origin===
* This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sun & Moon|Big Malasada|114}} from the {{TCG|Sun & Moon}} expansion.
* The [[Big Malasada]] is an item in the [[Pokémon games]] that removes all [[status condition]]s from a Pokémon, the equivalent of the TCG's {{TCG|Special Condition}}s.

